  <item>
    <title>7. 小红书上不能说的秘密</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699bdf61de29766da9369f45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699bdf61de29766da9369f45</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 05:07:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>往期的播客里，julia总爱向别人抛出一些尖锐的问题，试图理解她的朋友们和这个世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期她换了个视角，把问题收回来，好好审视一下自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些没法轻易说出口的，结结巴巴的话，大概就是这期要聊的秘密。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的chapter们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 久等了朋友们，我回来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 我为什么喜欢尖锐问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> 博主们还有心吗，我们还能看到吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 苹果活动看到何同学了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 一切都在流动，但我只能是我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> julia 的 ego 有点大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> julia 的表达欲也不小</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a> MBTI 也会搞错吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2385">39:45</a> 保留些尖锐的刺和不能说的秘密</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6767fbde7cebcde3b381072f/li_4JNydEoMaO-hl7IKHHaeIlxVY.m4a" length="44810386" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:10</itunes:duration>
